 tried again once, and that finished in all regions.\n- us-east, us-west and eu-west are now all on v2.3.0. The error rate has dropped from 18% to 0.2%.\n\n**Incident**\n- The request to create the incident timed out. I checked the incident list before trying again, and it had been created, so there's no duplicate and on-call was paged once.\n- INC-0001 is a SEV2 for checkout-api. It describes the bad release, the rollback (including the partial failure) and the current state.\n- It lists two follow-ups: find out why v2.3.1 broke, and look into the orchestrator error that stopped the first rollback.", "type": "text"}]}]}